    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37576" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξοπτ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bake thoroughly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῇ καμίνῳ τοὺς ἀμφορέας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.164
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σάρκας πυρί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					403
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				1005
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεμάχη ἐξωπτημένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pherecr.
					108.10
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				15.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὴν κάμινον</span>
			<i>heat</i> it <i>violently,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.163
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph., of
			love, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξοπτᾷ δ᾽ ἐμέ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					474.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
